    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="下载Arthas"><a href="#下载Arthas" class="headerlink" title="下载Arthas"></a>下载Arthas</h1><p>curl -O <span class="exturl" data-url="aHR0cHM6Ly9hcnRoYXMuYWxpeXVuLmNvbS9hcnRoYXMtYm9vdC5qYXI=">https://arthas.aliyun.com/arthas-boot.jar<i class="fa fa-external-link-alt"></i></span></p><h1 id="启动Arthas"><a href="#启动Arthas" class="headerlink" title="启动Arthas"></a>启动Arthas</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">java -jar arthas-boot.jar</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment"># 输入想要查看的Java进程ID, arthas会attach到对应进程</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="查询包含-quot-Generated-quot-关键字的Class"><a href="#查询包含-quot-Generated-quot-关键字的Class" class="headerlink" title="查询包含&quot;Generated&quot;关键字的Class"></a>查询包含&quot;Generated&quot;关键字的Class</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">sc *Generated*</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="反编译指定已加载类的源码"><a href="#反编译指定已加载类的源码" class="headerlink" title="反编译指定已加载类的源码"></a>反编译指定已加载类的源码</h1><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">jad a.b.c.TargetGeneratedClass</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
